This is a native bare-swift package; it is not derived from any upstream
Rust crate. Implements RFC 6902 (JSON Patch) directly, with path
resolution via swift-jsonpointer (RFC 6901) and value representation
via swift-json (RFC 8259).

RFC 6902: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902.html
